frames before the game starts do nothing
frame at 500 ms: no step, waiting, score 0, length 3, head at 10,10
the first frame after the start only records the time
frame at 1000 ms: no step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 10,10
a step is due 130 ms later, however many frames come in between
frame at 1016 ms: no step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 10,10
frame at 1100 ms: no step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 10,10
frame at 1129 ms: no step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 10,10
frame at 1130 ms: a step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 11,10
a late frame takes every step that is due: 270 ms is two steps
frame at 1400 ms: a step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 13,10
but at most 5 steps: after a long gap the rest of the time is dropped
frame at 9000 ms: a step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 18,10
frame at 9100 ms: no step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 18,10
a pause: no steps, turns are ignored, and the time paused does not count afterwards
frame at 9500 ms: no step, paused, score 0, length 3, head at 18,10
frame at 20000 ms: no step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 18,10
frame at 20130 ms: a step, playing, score 0, length 3, head at 19,10
into the wall
frame at 20260 ms: a step, over, score 0, length 3, head at 19,10
frame at 20390 ms: no step, over, score 0, length 3, head at 19,10
